      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Despite much debate, teething is commonly believed to include a cluster of distressing symptoms. Over the centuries various treatments have been used and fallen into disrepute. Homeopathy has a track record of consistent and effective management of teething, treating the whole child regardless of the source of the distress. This article explores the literature on teething and calls for more research to be directed towards homeopathy's holistic approach towards managing teething symptoms."},
